## Project Layout

- `Assets/` - art, audio, and other game content
- `Build/` - per-platform build configs and output (`dist/`)
- `Cache/` - engine-generated cache (shaders, etc.) - safe to delete
- `Config/` - project and platform settings
- `Logs/` - runtime logs
- `Mods/` - user-installed mods
- `Packages/` - installed packages/plugins
- `Source/` - project scripts
- `Temp/` - scratch files - safe to delete

## Engine

Built with Coreverse Engine `{{engine_version}}`.
